flowchart TD
    H[Story/Requirement] --> KICKOFF[workflow-kickoff<br/>Phase 0: Initialize]
    KICKOFF --> VERIFY[verify-install<br/>Phase 0.5: Validate Setup]
    VERIFY --> GIT_SETUP[git-flow<br/>Phase 1: Repository Setup]
    GIT_SETUP --> SPECIFY[specify<br/>Phase 2: Specification]
    SPECIFY --> CLARIFY[clarify<br/>Phase 3: Clarification]
    CLARIFY --> PLAN[plan<br/>Phase 4: Planning]
    PLAN --> REVIEW_PLAN{domain-review<br/>Optional: Validate Plan}
    REVIEW_PLAN -->|Yes| DOMAIN_PLAN[domain-review<br/>--target plan.md]
    REVIEW_PLAN -->|No| TASKS
    DOMAIN_PLAN --> TASKS[tasks<br/>Phase 5: Task Decomposition]
    TASKS --> IMPLEMENT[implement<br/>Phase 6: Code]
    IMPLEMENT --> REVIEW_IMPL{domain-review<br/>Optional: Pre-commit}
    REVIEW_IMPL -->|Yes| DOMAIN_IMPL[domain-review<br/>--mode incremental]
    REVIEW_IMPL -->|No| TEST
    DOMAIN_IMPL --> TEST[test<br/>Phase 7: Testing]
    TEST --> CODE_REVIEW[code-reviewer<br/>Phase 8: Review]
    CODE_REVIEW --> CLOSER[closer<br/>Phase 9: Finalize]
    CLOSER --> GIT_PUSH[git-flow<br/>Push & PR]
    GIT_PUSH --> CI[ci-monitor<br/>Phase 10: Monitor CI]

